WEBVTT

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:06.730
If that's what you want, I'll destroy you.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.300
<i>A sweet kiss</i>

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.270
<i>Bitter stimulation</i>

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:13.950
<i>Choose whichever you prefer</i>

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.960
What's most important to you?

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:16.050
<i>But if you say</i>

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.210
<i>You want both</i>

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:22.290
<i>Then I'll freely give you both</i>

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:26.670
<i>LOVE IN SECRET x SEXY NIGHT</i>

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:26.670
Quit showing off.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:30.730
<i>Don't run</i>

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:35.380
You may be strong, but you 
can't beat us, you insects!

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:34.460
<i>From impulses you don't yet know</i>

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:37.680
<i>Let me hear an even deeper cute voice</i>

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:41.970
<i>LOVE IN SECRET x SEXY NIGHT</i>

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:43.360
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:46.170
<i>You won't be able to forget anymore</i>

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:45.310
You disgust me.

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:49.830
<i>Don't worry about anything, just show me</i>

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:49.980
We're not losers!

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:50.800
<i>kiss & kiss</i>

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>hug & hug</i>

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:55.030
<i>you & me</i>

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:00.950
Sorry.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.180
Let me handle things here.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:05.710
Go to him.

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:11.420
<b>Barking Dogs</b>

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:14.170
<b>Coming Soon!</b>

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:14.170
Cut!

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:17.180
We're checking the video now.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:18.880
Give us a few minutes.

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:21.490
Good work.

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:22.710
Hey, you.

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:23.410
What?

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.260
You can't do that.

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:28.560
If the fake blood comes off, 
you'll mess up the continuity between cuts.

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:30.970
S-Sorry.

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:03.950
Excellent.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.340
It's good.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:07.720
<b>Flirtatious PLAY BOY</b>

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:10.310
Tsubasa, you should be more careful.

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:14.960
Sorry. It's my first time on a movie set, 
so I don't know what I'm doing.

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:19.860
I'm glad you're so worried about me, though.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:23.430
Of course I am. I'm B-Pro's A&R.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.470
Yeah, yeah. I knew you'd say that.

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:28.470
What?

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:30.970
Never mind. It's nothing.

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:35.350
Members of the cast, we need you 
to wait for about three hours.

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:40.590
Yashamaru-san.

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:41.650
You came.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:44.530
That was pretty good. 
The acting wasn't too bad, either.

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:45.990
Was I cool?

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:49.870
Of course. But don't be careless.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.000
This is a huge opportunity for you guys.

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:57.480
French director, Sophie Vebelle, 
is internationally famous.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:01.690
And this movie, <i>Les Chiens Aboient</i>,

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:04.510
is the first time she's taken up 
the megaphone outside of France.

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:09.870
The movie will open, not just 
in Japan, but worldwide.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:15.020
If it becomes a hit,
B-Pro might even go global.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:15.020
<b>Barking Dogs
[Final Script]</b>

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.520
There's a lot of downtime 
while shooting movies.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:23.290
It does feel like it takes a really 
long time to set up the sets and lights.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:27.040
Apparently, Director Vebelle 
is particularly fastidious.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:32.510
But what's a French director doing shooting 
a movie about Japanese delinquents?

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:35.720
Isn't it a universal concept?

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:39.780
We'd better make sure the movie 
lives up to her reputation.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:44.130
R-Really? I feel even more nervous now.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.550
It's a little late for that.

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:48.180
We just need to stay calm.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.310
L-Let's do our best.

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:53.270
You're more nervous than anyone else.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.040
Sorry.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.770
Sheesh.

00:04:57.170 --> 00:05:02.300
So where's our star who was chosen 
at the director's sole discretion?

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:04.550
Over there.

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:09.380
Aizome-san, take us out to eat sometime.

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:12.600
Sure. I found a delicious 
French place the other day.

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:13.670
Really? Where?

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:14.770
Aizome-san!

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.460
Aizome-san!

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:18.460
Ow! What are you doing?

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:21.420
Aizome-san, what are you doing?

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:23.720
Tsubasa, are you jealous?

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:25.550
A-Absolutely not!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:29.810
Oh, you. At least try not to cause a scandal.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:33.430
It's okay. I won't do anything like that.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:39.250
I-In any case, let's work together 
to make the movie a success.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.370
<i>Work together, huh?</i>

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:47.310
<i>But idols only ever think about
how to make themselves stand out.</i>

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:55.300
Oh, right. Ryu-chan, let's get 
that ready while we have time.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:57.000
Sure.

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:02.600
Then why did we suffer a surprise attack?

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:04.500
Is there a traitor among us?

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:09.010
That's right. The chairman sent an assassin.

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:11.080
Isn't that right?

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:12.660
What?

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:13.640
You must be joking.

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:15.900
How long have you known?

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:23.540
The chairman has poor taste in tobacco.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:25.800
I'm impressed.

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:32.130
So you already know it's us? That's no fun.

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:33.390
What should we do?

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:34.860
Isn't it obvious?

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.290
Destroy them!

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.420
You're not making it back to the chairman!

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:41.880
Stop!

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:44.850
Says the director.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.890
Your acting is terrible.

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:50.470
What?

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:53.010
You have no masculine charm.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:55.870
You need to make your acting sexier.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.230
Says the director.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:01.230
Sexy? Isn't this a delinquent movie?

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.030
But in contrast, you.

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:03.830
Me?

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.870
You were supremely sexy. It's excellent.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:09.780
Try to charm me even more.

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:11.990
Says the director.

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.740
As you wish.

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:18.250
She really likes Kento, doesn't she?

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:21.000
It looks that way.

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:23.520
What does this mean?

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:25.820
There's no scene like this in the script, right?

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:30.200
You can't even take off your clothes, 
even though you're a professional?

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.930
You think you're pretty important, don't you?

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.090
Says the director.

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:36.710
She's right. I agree.

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:39.300
What? Are you agreeing with 
everything the director says now?

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.450
Of course.

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:43.350
If you can't perform as you're instructed, 
you've failed as an actor.

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:47.360
This reminds of a certain gravure shoot.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:01.460
Cut!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:10.210
Kaneshiro-san, we need 
to reshoot your sections.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.750
You can't be serious! Why?

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:16.600
It looks like you're not getting 
along with the Parisienne, Goshi.

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:19.280
Incidentally, Aizome-san was excellent.

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:21.480
Says the director.

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:23.580
Merci.

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:25.460
Merci, my butt.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.810
Don't let it get to your head.

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:29.150
I'm not.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:33.130
But Goshi, if you hate this 
so much, why don't you quit?

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.360
What did you say?

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:37.870
Now, now. Why don't you guys have some tea?

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:38.830
Here.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.950
It's really bitter senburi tea.

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:46.580
Ashu!

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:49.340
I got you good!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.160
I-I don't believe this.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.840
What's your problem?

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:56.630
We're playing pranks for the "making of" video.

00:08:56.630 --> 00:09:01.470
We're trying to get a look at your real 
faces since you two always look so serious.

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:04.230
M-My bangs...

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:08.290
Does that mean the shower 
scene was a prank, too?

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:12.110
I thought it was weird that 
only I had to redo my shots.

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:14.610
No, that's real.

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:16.390
What?

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:21.560
Well, we should get going.

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.000
Good work today.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.590
Is Kitakore already finished for the day?

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:28.880
Yes. From here on out, 
it'll be a THRIVE-only shoot.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:33.380
Either way, they always make us wait too long.

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:37.620
It's taking some time to set up the equipment.

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.990
I told you, it's not like that.

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:41.910
Says the director.

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:44.530
What's wrong?

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:49.040
The director wants to shoot 
the next scene at a big river.

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.670
A big river?

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:51.870
Wow!

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:54.400
But do we have permission to do that?

00:09:55.670 --> 00:10:01.320
My French staff would get me permission 
to shoot on the Seine in ten minutes.

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:03.790
Says the director.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.790
But that's not...

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:07.770
Are they arguing about something?

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:11.290
At this rate, they won't 
be able to keep filming.

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:13.790
Aizome, you're up.

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:17.390
You're good at handling most women, right?

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:22.510
Good grief. I guess the 
star has to do something.

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.270
What is he up to?

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:31.990
Bonjour, madam. Can we talk?

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.600
It's about the river.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:37.180
I believe an attractive woman like yourself

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:40.340
has the right to demand whatever 
she wants at any time.

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:45.540
But I'd appreciate it if you'd let it go today.

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:53.920
I've been watching since we started filming,

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.660
but you're awfully full of yourself, aren't you?

00:10:57.220 --> 00:11:00.870
Do you think women will do whatever you want?

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:05.080
Isn't the reason you do that 
because you're afraid of getting hurt?

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:11.500
You don't trust anyone, 
but you're always relying on others.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:13.560
You're like a spoiled child.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:21.440
Says the director.

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:26.200
J-Just kidding. Ken-Ken loves to joke around.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.450
Japanese joke.

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:29.890
Right, Tsubasa-chan?

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:31.740
What? Oh, yes.

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:34.480
Yes, that's right. Right, Aizome-san?

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:37.240
Aizome-san?

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:43.260
We actually got permission to film here.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.350
This production is on a totally different scale.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:48.030
Gochin, you can have this.

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:55.110
Got you again!

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.110
Gotcha!

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.110
<b>Gotcha!!</b>

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.480
I told you to stop doing that!

00:11:57.890 --> 00:11:59.780
I captured your reaction perfectly.

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:02.680
Bushy brows, you don't have any scenes today.

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:05.090
I'm the "making of" cameraman.

00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:06.330
The what?

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:08.490
By the way, where's Ken-Ken?

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:10.570
In the bus.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:13.500
This isn't like him.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.910
You think he's depressed?

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:17.750
What? Why?

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:23.390
I think what the director said 
yesterday really cut Ken-Ken deep.

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.030
Let's start filming!

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:28.010
I'll go get Aizome-san.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:33.390
Excuse me, but there's been a change 
of plans I'd like to confirm later.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:38.290
Kaneshiro-san says his line, 
and the other delinquents surround him.

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:37.640
Ken-Ken?

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:38.770
Yeah.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:41.560
The script after that has been changed.

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:43.570
Hey, are you listening?

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:44.990
When Kaneshiro-san and Aizome-san 
are standing back to back,

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:47.530
Yeah, okay. I can do whatever.

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:47.530
and Kaneshiro-san says, 
"Let me handle things here..."

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:51.540
Camera's rolling! Ready, start!

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:53.540
Damn it. They caught up!

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:01.170
This isn't good. We don't have 
time to be slowed down here.

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:02.920
Yeah, I know.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.160
Sorry, but I'm taking all the fun.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:06.930
What?

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:08.670
Let me handle things here.

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:09.810
Go to him.

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:10.560
What?

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:19.230
I knew he wasn't listening!

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:28.240
Are you okay?

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.400
What was that for?

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:30.250
What?

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:32.110
Why did you push me off the bridge?

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:33.160
What are you talking about?

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:35.120
You messed up my bangs!

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:37.450
Guys, stop!

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:43.030
This has been one disaster after another.

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:45.390
Don't be ridiculous. 
I could say the same thing.

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:46.090
What?

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:49.890
Because you weren't listening, 
I had one hell of a time!

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:52.540
I didn't ask for your help.

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:54.390
You're the one who jumped in.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:55.310
What?

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:56.830
That's enough!

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:00.790
Ken-Ken.

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:02.770
Yuta?

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:05.400
That was your fault, Ken-Ken.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:06.910
You should apologize.

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:19.070
Aizome-san.

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:22.840
I can see your underwear.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:23.840
What?

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:25.850
Just kidding.

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:32.830
What's wrong?

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:35.080
You're not acting like your usual self.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.310
My usual self?

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:40.350
This is who I am.

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:41.990
You're wrong.

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:45.100
You're someone who pays 
attention to his surroundings

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:46.360
and is considerate of his friends.

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:49.420
That's an awfully convenient
interpretation of my behavior, isn't it?

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:53.960
I don't care about teams or friends.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:58.040
I'm the one who gets hurt 
when they betray me.

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:04.380
Besides, the kind of people who become 
idols only think of themselves.

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:06.760
That's definitely not true.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:07.760
What?

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:14.010
Why did you want to become 
an idol, Aizome-san?

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.510
Isn't it obvious?

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:20.810
To get women.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.150
After all, idols get tons of girls.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:26.150
You're lying.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.730
It's true.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:42.110
The director's right. I'm empty inside.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.840
But I do my best to pretend I'm not.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:49.550
As long as someone wants me, 
I feel like I'm alive.

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:53.310
After all, I've always been alone.

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:59.580
Even if all they're after are my looks, 
their attention fulfills me.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:02.060
It makes me feel at ease.

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:04.710
Aizome-san...

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:13.570
I know what it's like to be so lonely 
it feels like there's a hole in your heart.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:19.040
But you're not as alone as you think you are.

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:21.080
Tsubasa...

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:25.830
I felt it clearly when you returned 
from being lost at sea the other day.

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:31.360
You've become a single team as B-Pro.

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:34.590
That's why every one of you is essential.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:39.370
Sorry, but unlike the other members,

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:43.900
I don't have the fastidiousness or 
willpower or charm of the other members.

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:46.580
Aizome-san, you are attractive.

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:51.320
If you weren't, you wouldn't be 
an idol who captivates so many people.

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:58.320
Are you saying you still like me even 
after knowing what I'm like on the inside?

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:00.080
Of course.

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:09.170
You're not guarded at all, are you?

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.000
What?

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:13.440
Did I say something weird?

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:17.590
No. Maybe it's charming 
because of who you are.

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.110
D-Don't make fun of me!

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:22.350
I'm serious.

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:24.970
You like who I am on the inside, right?

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:30.790
E-Everyone's waiting. We should head back.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:37.280
No stuntmen? No rehearsal?

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:39.030
No one told me anything about that!

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:41.650
This is an important scene.

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:45.790
We'll be shooting without stuntmen 
to capture their tense expressions.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:48.040
That's crazy.

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:50.600
We've carefully measured the gunpowder.

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:53.890
As long as everything is done correctly, 
it shouldn't be dangerous.

00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:55.170
But...

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:58.210
The director is asking if you can't even do—

00:17:58.210 --> 00:17:59.770
Of course we can.

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:04.310
Says the starring actor.

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:05.250
Aizome.

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:06.310
Ken-Ken.

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:10.980
Camera's rolling on the explosion scene!

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:14.320
Focus, everyone!

00:18:15.230 --> 00:18:17.570
Ready, start!

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:20.270
They can't be serious!

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:22.240
Wh-What are we going to do?

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:25.400
Quit complaining, and let's get out of here!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:27.790
All right.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:30.170
Untie mine, too.

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:33.460
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:36.620
<i>We should've had at least another 
minute until the next explosion.</i>

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:39.180
<i>The explosions are happening 
ahead of schedule.</i>

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:42.050
Hey, is this a prank, too?

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:44.060
I wouldn't pull a prank like this.

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:46.060
It's not coming off.

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:49.340
I-Isn't this different from what was planned?

00:18:49.340 --> 00:18:50.810
Are they okay?

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:54.320
The explosions are happening 
more rapidly than we planned.

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:55.850
Why?

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:58.070
How long until the final explosion?

00:18:58.390 --> 00:19:00.070
Thirty seconds.

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:01.730
Gochin, hurry!

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:03.070
Damn it!

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:04.580
Ten more seconds.

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:08.710
Forget about me. Just go!

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:10.260
We can't do that!

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:12.880
At this rate, all three of us...

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:13.880
Five seconds...

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:16.000
No. We have to get out together!

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:19.010
Every member of the team is essential!

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:21.710
I don't care about teams or friends.

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:25.740
I'm the one who gets hurt when they betray me.

00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:27.140
Two...

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:32.650
Besides, the kind of people who become 
idols only think of themselves.

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.570
I must've been talking about myself.

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:48.790
<b>Gotcha!!</b>

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:49.820
Kento, I caught your fantastic expression.

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:50.540
What?

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:54.420
I told you. We're playing pranks 
for the "making of" video.

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:56.280
What?

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:57.250
Ashu!

00:19:57.520 --> 00:20:00.260
No, wait! I didn't know, either!

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:04.390
This was a prank played by B-Pro on THRIVE.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:06.960
What a masterpiece.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:10.890
<b>Gotcha!!</b>

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:10.890
I could eat heaps of rice after 
seeing those panicked expressions.

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:13.900
You completely fell for it.

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:17.220
Ba-dump! There were similarities 
between this spectacle

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:22.160
and episode 22 of <i>Witch Girl Mamirin</i>, 
"The Cupcake and the White Rabbit," Momotasu!

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:25.410
I'm not sure what you're talking about, 
but I'm sure you're right.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.800
You guys...

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:29.660
A-A prank?

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:34.680
Oh, good.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:37.650
Huh? Ryuji?

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:38.750
Did you tell Tsubasa?

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:41.090
Uh, oh. I forgot to tell her.

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:44.300
I thought they were done for.

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:47.550
Maybe I should've told you.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:48.880
Très bien.

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:52.640
What?

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:56.090
I made you the star because

00:20:56.090 --> 00:21:00.670
I wanted to see the real kindness 
and passion behind your mask, Kento.

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:03.950
Real kindness and passion?

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:08.030
That was captured on this VTR.

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:11.490
I'll be using it in the final cut.

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:12.670
Is that all right?

00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:15.010
That's what she said?

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:15.760
Yes.

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:19.600
Of course I don't mind if you use that footage.

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:23.340
But I do have one condition.

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:29.350
Would you accompany me to the delicious 
French restaurant I found recently?

00:21:32.510 --> 00:21:33.350
Oui.

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:37.730
Ken-Ken's back to his usual self.

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:40.360
He really hasn't learned his lesson.

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:20.000
Goshi, Yuta.

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:21.460
Huh? What?

00:23:22.360 --> 00:23:23.710
Listen...

00:23:24.180 --> 00:23:27.480
All right! Let's go eat at Ganjara Ramen!

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:28.590
You're paying, Ken-Ken.

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.720
What? But I'm not sure 
I feel like ramen at this hour.

00:23:32.720 --> 00:23:34.930
You're not saying no, are you?

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:40.230
Yeah. After all, didn't you want to apologize?

00:23:41.260 --> 00:23:44.950
And you'll be taking us with you, right?

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:50.740
I guess I don't have a choice.

00:23:56.140 --> 00:23:57.630
I'm not letting you go to sleep yet.

00:23:57.630 --> 00:23:59.950
It's time for the adults to have their fun.
